---
---
<!-- 5. SERVICES — EDITORIAL LARGE ROWS -->
<section class="w-full py-14 sm:py-24 lg:py-28 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-8 sm:mb-16">
      <span class="font-label text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] uppercase font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] sm:tracking-[0.22em] text-primary block mb-2">
        What We Do
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight">
        Everything You Need.<br/>Under One Roof.
      </h2>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Large Rows -->
    <div class="flex flex-col divide-y divide-outline-variant/30">
      
      <!-- Row 01 -->
      <div class="py-6 sm:py-10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-6 group hover:bg-surface-container-low px-2 sm:px-4 rounded-xl transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-start lg:items-center gap-4 sm:gap-8 lg:w-1/3">
          <span class="font-headline text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            01 / ARCHITECTURE
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl leading-relaxed lg:w-1/2">
          Schematic planning, volumetric 3D BIM models, spatial flow choreography, and parametric facade engineering crafted to municipal zoning codes.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between lg:justify-end gap-4 sm:gap-6 lg:w-1/6">
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-widest text-outline bg-surface-container px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1 sm:py-1.5 rounded">
            BIM &amp; Massing
          </span>
          <a class="text-primary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform p-1" href="/services/architecture" aria-label="Explore Architecture service">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Row 02 -->
      <div class="py-6 sm:py-10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-6 group hover:bg-surface-container-low px-2 sm:px-4 rounded-xl transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-start lg:items-center gap-4 sm:gap-8 lg:w-1/3">
          <span class="font-headline text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            02 / CONSTRUCTION
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl leading-relaxed lg:w-1/2">
          Complete civil and structural engineering, reinforced concrete superstructure framing, continuous site supervision, and rigorous grade-A concrete QA audits.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between lg:justify-end gap-4 sm:gap-6 lg:w-1/6">
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-widest text-outline bg-surface-container px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1 sm:py-1.5 rounded">
            Structural &amp; Civil
          </span>
          <a class="text-primary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform p-1" href="/services/construction" aria-label="Explore Construction service">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Row 03 -->
      <div class="py-6 sm:py-10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-6 group hover:bg-surface-container-low px-2 sm:px-4 rounded-xl transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-start lg:items-center gap-4 sm:gap-8 lg:w-1/3">
          <span class="font-headline text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            03 / INTERIORS
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl leading-relaxed lg:w-1/2">
          Bespoke architectural joinery, monolithic stone features, curated European materials, and zoned architectural lighting choreography for effortless luxury.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between lg:justify-end gap-4 sm:gap-6 lg:w-1/6">
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-widest text-outline bg-surface-container px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1 sm:py-1.5 rounded">
            Custom Millwork
          </span>
          <a class="text-primary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform p-1" href="/services/interiors" aria-label="Explore Interiors service">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Row 04 -->
      <div class="py-6 sm:py-10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-6 group hover:bg-surface-container-low px-2 sm:px-4 rounded-xl transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-start lg:items-center gap-4 sm:gap-8 lg:w-1/3">
          <span class="font-headline text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            04 / PROJECT MANAGEMENT
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl leading-relaxed lg:w-1/2">
          Single-point procurement, statutory sanction clearances, milestone billing gates, and zero-defect handover guarantee with real-time digital monitoring.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between lg:justify-end gap-4 sm:gap-6 lg:w-1/6">
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-widest text-outline bg-surface-container px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1 sm:py-1.5 rounded">
            Turnkey Execution
          </span>
          <a class="text-primary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform p-1" href="/services/project-management" aria-label="Explore Project Management service">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
